#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guided_tours.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From offering group or private tours online to managing on-site bookings and "
"analyzing performance, Odoo gives tour operators the tools to grow and "
"streamline their business in one intuitive platform."
msgstr ""
"De la vente de visites de groupe ou privées en ligne à la gestion des "
"réservations sur place et à l’analyse des performances, Odoo donne aux "
"organisateurs de visites guidées tous les outils pour se développer et "
"rationaliser leurs activités — le tout sur une plateforme intuitive."

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_4
msgid ""
"From the bustling energy of Piazza Navona to the serene beauty of the Trevi "
"Fountain, this tour weaves together Rome’s dramatic history with its rich "
"cultural traditions.\n"
"Relax in ultimate comfort as you take in panoramic views, with curated stops "
"designed to capture perfect photos and soak in the vibrant atmosphere. "
"Naturally, we won't let you explore without a taste of local culture: enjoy "
"an authentic espresso, a bite of fresh biscotti, or a taste of artisanal "
"gelato along the way."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_3
msgid ""
"From the spiritual tranquility of Ubud’s ancient temples to breathtaking "
"coastal viewpoints overlooking the Indian Ocean, you’ll experience the true "
"soul of the island.\n"
"Travel in cool, air-conditioned comfort while soaking in dramatic views of "
"volcanic peaks and tropical forests, with ample time to step off, snap "
"stunning photos, and breathe in the island breeze. Along the route, treat "
"your senses to local flavors, from freshly cracked coconut water to "
"traditional Balinese sweet treats."
msgstr ""

